             <t indent="0" pn="section-4.1.4.2-1">The Printer <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> supply and the Client <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> support the following
 <bcp14>REQUIRED</bcp14> operation attributes in every IPP/1.1 operation response:</t>
