+processing Job Creation requests.</dd>
+            </dl>
+            <t indent="0" pn="section-4.2.1.2-4">Group 2: Unsupported Attributes</t>
+            <t indent="0" pn="section-4.2.1.2-5">See Section 4.1.7 for details on returning unsupported attributes.</t>
+            <t indent="0" pn="section-4.2.1.2-6">The value of &quot;ipp-attribute-fidelity&quot; supplied by the Client does
+not affect what attributes the Printer returns in this group.  The
+value of &quot;ipp-attribute-fidelity&quot; only affects whether the
+Print-Job operation is accepted or rejected.  If the Job is
+accepted, the Client can query the Job using the
