+            <t indent="0" pn="section-4.2.1.2-7">Group 3: Job Attributes</t>
+            <dl newline="true" spacing="normal" indent="3" pn="section-4.2.1.2-8">
+              <dt pn="section-4.2.1.2-8.1">&quot;job-id&quot; (integer(1:MAX)):</dt>
+              <dd pn="section-4.2.1.2-8.2">The Printer <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> return the Job's ID in the <bcp14>REQUIRED</bcp14> &quot;job-id&quot;
+Job attribute.  The Client uses this &quot;job-id&quot; attribute in
+conjunction with the &quot;printer-uri&quot; attribute used in the
