+              <dt pn="section-4.2.1.2-8.3">&quot;job-uri&quot; (uri):</dt>
+              <dd pn="section-4.2.1.2-8.4">The Printer <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> return the Job's URI by returning the contents
+of the <bcp14>REQUIRED</bcp14> &quot;job-uri&quot; Job attribute.</dd>
+              <dt pn="section-4.2.1.2-8.5">&quot;job-state&quot; (type1 enum):</dt>
+              <dd pn="section-4.2.1.2-8.6">The Printer <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> return the Job's <bcp14>REQUIRED</bcp14> &quot;job-state&quot;
+attribute.  The value of this attribute along with the value of
+the &quot;job-state-reasons&quot; attribute is a &quot;snapshot&quot; of the new
