+attribute.</dd>
+              <dt pn="section-4.2.1.2-8.9">&quot;job-state-message&quot; (text(MAX)):</dt>
+              <dd pn="section-4.2.1.2-8.10">The Printer <bcp14>SHOULD</bcp14> return the Job's <bcp14>RECOMMENDED</bcp14>
+&quot;job-state-message&quot; attribute.  If the Printer supports this
+attribute, then it <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> be returned in the response.  If this
