-   'aborted' state, or (3) has been aborted by the system and placed
-   in the 'pending-held' state, so that a user or Operator can
-   manually try the Job again.  This value <bcp14>SHOULD</bcp14> be supported.</li>
-          </ul>
-          <ul bare="false" empty="false" indent="3" spacing="normal" pn="section-5.3.8-24">
-            <li pn="section-5.3.8-24.1"> 'unsupported-compression': The Job was aborted by the system
