+            <li pn="section-5.3.8-5.26">'job-completed-successfully': The Job completed successfully.
+This value <bcp14>SHOULD</bcp14> be supported.</li>
+            <li pn="section-5.3.8-5.27">'job-completed-with-warnings': The Job completed with warnings.
